<title>USA: Stewart Enterprises issues $100 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Stewart Enterprises issues $100 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Stewart Enterprises Inc was priced Wednesday, according to lead manager NationsBanc Capital Markets Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER STEWART ENTERPRISES INC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 6.70 PCT   MATURITY 12/01/2003</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 06/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD  6.70 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 72 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
